; Yes! We Have No Bananas (Frank Silver / Irving Cohn, 1923)
; The refrain, from the 1923 Skidmore / Shapiro, Bernstein sheet music (IMSLP #738884, public
; domain): melody as written, in C, the changes read off the piano part. Bar 32 is the piano's
; first-ending fill, given to the horn to lead back to the top. Each line ends with its bar numbers.

[song]
